WEBVTT

00:13.610 --> 00:21.220
Far away from the town where I was born

00:21.220 --> 00:24.390
I am singing

00:24.390 --> 00:32.030
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

00:32.030 --> 00:35.300
Away in my pocket

00:35.300 --> 00:40.840
Toward where I hear someone calling me

00:40.840 --> 00:45.870
Toward the unknown road

00:45.870 --> 00:51.310
I'll walk

00:51.310 --> 00:56.720
I'll move forward

00:56.720 --> 01:01.560
Not for someone else's sake

01:01.560 --> 01:07.030
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:07.030 --> 01:12.500
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:12.500 --> 01:17.740
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:17.740 --> 01:21.770
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:23.410 --> 01:26.940
I live

01:33.720 --> 01:37.450
Episode 51
To Where the Wind Blows

01:42.100 --> 01:44.570
So, I was right, then?

01:45.300 --> 01:48.930
Zed is the true savior after all.

01:49.870 --> 01:52.500
But he's suffering so much!

01:53.010 --> 01:54.010
Roya, wait!

01:54.010 --> 01:55.640
Zed!

01:57.810 --> 01:59.150
Roya!

01:59.150 --> 02:00.770
Zed...

02:29.910 --> 02:31.710
Amir Gaul...

02:34.550 --> 02:36.180
Zed!

02:37.250 --> 02:38.620
Zed!

02:38.620 --> 02:41.420
Master Zico, Zed is...

02:41.990 --> 02:45.260
Zed is the true savior.

02:45.260 --> 02:48.390
All we can do is believe in that.

02:49.230 --> 02:50.860
Zed...

03:13.720 --> 03:17.680
So, that's Tusker's true face.

03:20.730 --> 03:23.630
No!

03:23.630 --> 03:27.170
No! I'm scared!

03:27.170 --> 03:30.070
Noah! Zed!

03:30.070 --> 03:32.510
Princess, are you all right?!

03:32.510 --> 03:36.640
So, this time has come, then?

03:40.820 --> 03:42.950
What do you mean we can't
make contact with Tusk?

03:42.950 --> 03:44.290
What's going on?!

03:44.290 --> 03:45.290
Beats me,

03:45.290 --> 03:47.750
but losing our heads isn't going to help anything.

03:50.730 --> 03:55.530
So, this is Tusker's true form?!

04:32.700 --> 04:38.740
All you spirits dormant in all the lands,
come forth!

04:38.740 --> 04:43.510
The time has come to obliterate this
world the humans have shaped,

04:43.510 --> 04:48.520
and create a new world for the spirits.

04:48.520 --> 04:51.650
Create a new world for the spirits?

04:51.650 --> 04:55.590
That's Tusker's goal?

04:55.590 --> 04:58.220
But then what will happen to Zed?

05:13.070 --> 05:14.700
Guardian!

05:17.080 --> 05:18.710
Belladonna?

05:19.810 --> 05:21.750
Slugna?

05:21.750 --> 05:23.120
Armadole?

05:23.120 --> 05:24.220
Mickey!

05:24.220 --> 05:26.850
What the heck is going on?

05:35.360 --> 05:37.900
It looks like the spirits dwelling in the ground

05:37.900 --> 05:40.370
are being drawn out by something.

05:40.370 --> 05:42.900
This is a bad omen, Guzma.

05:42.900 --> 05:44.530
Yeah...

05:52.810 --> 05:54.780
Apcarel?

05:54.780 --> 05:57.250
They're completely under Tusker's control,

05:57.950 --> 06:01.250
but don't you give up, Roya!

06:01.790 --> 06:04.260
That's right, we have Zed.

06:04.960 --> 06:08.260
There's no way he'll just stay lost
inside Tusker like this.

06:10.470 --> 06:12.090
Zed...

06:18.210 --> 06:20.000
Where am I?!

06:20.910 --> 06:23.910
What am I doing here?

06:23.910 --> 06:28.620
Your self no longer exists.

06:28.620 --> 06:31.520
You shall become a part of me.

06:31.520 --> 06:33.320
Who are you?!

06:35.790 --> 06:37.730
I am power.

06:37.730 --> 06:39.430
Power?

06:39.430 --> 06:41.730
The power to create this world.

06:41.730 --> 06:45.370
The power to destroy all things.

06:45.370 --> 06:49.200
I shall become one with you,

06:49.200 --> 06:52.110
and destroy everything in this world.

06:52.110 --> 06:57.080
And then I will transform it into a world for spirits.

06:57.080 --> 06:59.250
A world for spirits?

06:59.250 --> 07:01.180
You have been chosen

07:01.180 --> 07:06.140
to see that through to its end
as the last living human.

07:06.920 --> 07:13.880
Your power will destroy all,
and create a new world.

07:14.930 --> 07:16.130
Yes...

07:16.130 --> 07:19.760
You are Tusker.

07:43.860 --> 07:45.660
Tusk Castle!

08:00.270 --> 08:02.900
Master Zico, the spirits are...

08:17.630 --> 08:19.250
Zed...

08:29.700 --> 08:31.510
Don't let them inside the castle!

08:31.510 --> 08:33.970
Hold them back at all costs!

08:38.410 --> 08:40.880
Come on, now, Belladonna...

08:48.860 --> 08:50.420
Mickey, I'm scared!

08:50.420 --> 08:52.550
It will be okay, Pinot.

09:23.990 --> 09:25.690
Master Zico!

09:25.690 --> 09:27.490
Roya, no!

09:38.010 --> 09:39.630
Master Zico!

09:49.680 --> 09:51.480
Is this...

09:59.730 --> 10:01.520
Who brought it?!

10:03.700 --> 10:05.500
You're...

10:07.000 --> 10:09.970
