10:20.250 --> 10:22.250
Don't say that!

10:22.250 --> 10:30.320
Roya, I'm not worried about you at all now.

10:30.320 --> 10:32.930
I know you can walk just fine...

10:32.930 --> 10:37.230
...on your own two feet.

10:37.800 --> 10:39.700
Master Zico!

10:39.700 --> 10:43.640
My destiny has run its course.

10:43.640 --> 10:45.270
