10:46.970 --> 10:53.110
Take care of Zed, Roya.

10:57.650 --> 10:59.280
Master Zico...

10:59.750 --> 11:01.220
Master Zico!

11:01.620 --> 11:05.080
Master Zico!

11:11.200 --> 11:13.670
Do it, Ex Machina!

11:19.670 --> 11:23.080
I'm going to use this artificial spirit Ex Machina

11:23.080 --> 11:25.380
to put up one hell of a resistance!

11:36.620 --> 11:38.920
