11:47.640 --> 11:50.070
Pretty stubborn, aren't you?

11:50.070 --> 11:52.370
You're going to be worth taking down!

12:30.580 --> 12:32.150
Damn it!

12:32.150 --> 12:34.440
I can't believe how powerful he is!

12:39.990 --> 12:41.590
